(Acme Corp Remote Work Handbook) Tj
T*
(2026 Edition) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Welcome to Acme Corp. This handbook explains our remote work policy. It) Tj
T*
(applies to all full-time employees and is reviewed each year by the People) Tj
T*
(team.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(1. Eligibility) Tj
T*
(Full-time employees become eligible for remote work after their first 90) Tj
T*
(days of employment. Contractors and interns require manager approval before) Tj
T*
(working remotely.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(2. Remote Schedule) Tj
T*
(Employees may work remotely up to 3 days per week. Working remotely for more) Tj
T*
(than 3 days in a week requires written approval from your direct manager.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(3. Core Hours) Tj
T*
(All employees must be available during core hours of 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM in) Tj
T*
(their local time zone. Outside core hours you may arrange your schedule as) Tj
T*
(needed to complete your work.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
