(Acme Corp Remote Work Handbook \(continued\)) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(4. Equipment and Expenses) Tj
T*
(Acme provides a home office equipment stipend of $500 per year. Employees) Tj
T*
(may also claim an internet reimbursement of $40 per month with a receipt.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(5. Security) Tj
T*
(A company VPN is required when accessing internal systems from home. Using a) Tj
T*
(password manager is mandatory. Confidential work must never be done over) Tj
T*
(public Wi-Fi networks.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(6. Meetings) Tj
T*
(Cameras are optional during video meetings. Meeting recordings are stored) Tj
T*
(for 90 days and then automatically deleted.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(7. Time Off) Tj
T*
(Employees receive 20 days of paid time off \(PTO\) per year. Please request) Tj
T*
(PTO at least 2 weeks in advance through the HR portal.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(8. Contacts) Tj
T*
(For technical help, email it-help@acme.example. For policy questions,) Tj
T*
(contact the People team at people@acme.example.) Tj
T*
ET
